    "detailed_description": "<strong>Death Slayer</strong> is a 2D Metroidvania-style platformer with frenetic action, the objective is to defeat all the enemies in the room in order to unlock access to the final boss of each level.<br><br>Immerse yourself in this adventure where you control Asura, a young swordswoman whose goal is to eradicate the evil that torments her lands.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>\u00b7 Wide variety of enemies and bosses, each with their own unique design and attack pattern.<br><br>\u00b7 Different character moves that you will need to master in order to progress through the game.<br><br>\u00b7 Intuitive controls that are easy to learn.<br><br>\u00b7 Retro style level design and artwork that will take you back to the 90's.<br><br>\u00b7 Excellent soundtrack that will immerse you in every level.",
